# Host-loop decision-trace rows (tests/harness/check_loop_trace.sh). Each row is
# one run with OPENPETE_LOOP_TRACE set; its trace digest, record count and exit
# code must equal the row of tests/golden/spyro-3/loop-trace-baseline.tsv.
#
# Fields: row | kind | source | launch | covers
#   kind    boot (no movie), bk2 (source replayed with --bk2-stop-on-end to
#           --frame-limit 6000, unlocked), setup-ftl / setup-pace (a session
#           that fails its setup on a frame-time log / pace log in a missing
#           directory; exit 3), windowed (Xvfb, --record-cfr 119.652 virtual
#           clock; run only under --windowed)
#   launch  extra arguments; an upper-case KEY=VALUE token is an environment
#           entry
#   covers  engagement terms: NAME (count above zero), NAME=N (count equal to
#           N), log:TEXT (the run log has a line containing TEXT, ~ for a
#           space). Counts: tests/harness/looptrace.py counts.
#
# The movie has no rewind-hold point (the state-roundtrip gate has no
# rewind-driver leg for this game), so there is no t2-hold row.
#
# row      | kind       | source                                       | launch                                   | covers
t1         | boot       | -                                            | --frame-limit 40000                      | canon-inline close_steps
t2-ra      | bk2        | sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry.bk2  | --runahead 2 OPENPETE_RA_PREDICT_CHECK=1 | canon-inline speculated left
t2-stress  | bk2        | sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry.bk2  | --state-stress 1                         | canon-inline log:savestate:~stress:
t2-rw      | bk2        | sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry.bk2  | --state-stress-rewind 25                 | canon-inline rollbacks
t3         | windowed   | -                                            | --frame-limit 8000                       | canon-lag intermediate v-strict
t3b        | windowed   | -                                            | --frame-limit 8000 OPENPETE_PACE_INJECT_PRESENT_US=8000,20000,32 OPENPETE_PACE_LATE_BUDGET_US=2000 | v-strict late-admit probe shed
